    "majority_rock_solid": "The 12-person Sebastian bloc (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 15) remains unyielding. Their coordinated response in Round 7 systematically anticipated and crushed the Lovett pivot and the Voragine objection: (1) 'The pictures' = gallery canvases in Midwestern slang, (2) Lovett's hair was dubbed an 'eraserhead' or 'pompadour', not porcupine quills, (3) Voragine proves how intrinsic the quill simile is to arrows in flesh, and (4) 'two words that start with the same letter' is trivia code for an honorific title like 'Saint'.",
    "target_persuadability": "Colleagues 3, 6, 10, and 15 (the original Round 0 Lovett supporters) did NOT peel off; in fact, 10 and 15 wrote detailed refutations of Lovett. The Sebastian bloc will not break into a minority.",
